WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.508
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.778 --> 00:07.779
Excuse me.

3
00:08.363 --> 00:10.115
Is the boss, Mr. Kureta, here?

4
00:10.198 --> 00:12.283
That would be me.

5
00:13.701 --> 00:16.913
We are here for an inspection from the district's Building Division.

6
00:18.998 --> 00:20.375
I am Tachibana.

7
00:21.376 --> 00:22.919
We ask for your cooperation.

8
00:24.045 --> 00:28.091
An on-site inspection? Why us?

9
00:28.174 --> 00:32.095
We received a complaint of building code violations here.

10
00:32.178 --> 00:33.638
Hey, you, don't film!

11
00:33.721 --> 00:35.056
I don't mind.

12
00:36.224 --> 00:39.310
Show us your transactions over the past six months.

13
00:39.394 --> 00:41.020
-Huh? -Can you do that?

14
00:41.104 --> 00:42.730
Six months' worth…

15
00:43.940 --> 00:46.109
No problem.

16
00:48.236 --> 00:50.238
Thank you for your cooperation.

17
00:50.321 --> 00:51.739
Sorry for the trouble.

18
00:52.240 --> 00:54.117
-Get to work. -Yes.

19
00:59.414 --> 01:00.957
MIRAVIO-KORIN PROJECT

20
01:07.297 --> 01:09.966
I reckon this will put them in their place for a bit.

21
01:11.301 --> 01:13.636
We finally got the governor's endorsement.

22
01:13.720 --> 01:16.556
We can't afford to have them ruin our plans.

23
01:16.639 --> 01:18.683
Prepare for the press conference.

24
01:18.766 --> 01:20.226
I will.

25
01:24.939 --> 01:28.860
I am terribly sorry. The city office won't grant the permit.

26
01:29.360 --> 01:31.529
No, there weren't any problems…

27
01:32.155 --> 01:34.365
Yes. Pardon me.

28
01:35.783 --> 01:37.827
Mr. Kureta, what happened?

29
01:37.911 --> 01:40.121
The city office inspected us.

30
01:40.204 --> 01:42.165
Seems they had some suspicions.

31
01:42.248 --> 01:46.127
They won't issue us building permits until their investigation ends.

32
01:46.210 --> 01:47.503
So…

33
01:47.587 --> 01:49.631
your business was basically suspended?

34
01:49.714 --> 01:50.757
This is ridiculous!

35
01:50.840 --> 01:52.634
-Any reason you can think of? -No.

36
01:52.717 --> 01:54.135
Could this also be…

37
01:54.844 --> 01:57.013
Representative Furuse's doing?

38
02:11.569 --> 02:12.779
It's Aso.

39
02:13.279 --> 02:16.074
The Hakari office just got inspected.

40
02:16.574 --> 02:17.992
Was it your doing?

41
02:18.660 --> 02:21.663
Are you Representative Furuse's henchman?

42
02:22.163 --> 02:24.540
Were you also involved in the case ten years ago?

43
02:24.624 --> 02:25.917
Fine.

44
02:26.000 --> 02:27.752
I will tell you everything.

45
02:28.253 --> 02:32.757
May I choose the time and location for our meeting?

46
02:43.142 --> 02:45.728
I never expected you would come.

47
02:46.771 --> 02:48.231
Ten years ago,

48
02:49.023 --> 02:51.192
the urban development of Konan City

49
02:51.275 --> 02:55.113
was led directly by Furuse, who was Minister of MLIT at the time.

50
02:55.196 --> 02:58.491
Furuse's aggressive development faced opposition

51
02:58.574 --> 03:01.077
from residents, led by a lawyer.

52
03:01.869 --> 03:03.454
Miyuki.

53
03:10.003 --> 03:16.009
Miyuki approached Furuse's secretary, Takeshi Nitou.

54
03:16.718 --> 03:18.761
And then something happened.

55
03:23.307 --> 03:24.767
Takeshi Nitou was…

56
03:26.310 --> 03:28.021
my father.

57
03:29.063 --> 03:30.440
And she killed him.

58
03:34.986 --> 03:36.654
No.

59
03:37.155 --> 03:39.157
Miyuki didn't kill him.

60
03:39.240 --> 03:40.408
Don't mess with me!

61
03:40.491 --> 03:44.746
Your sister killed my father!

62
03:45.538 --> 03:47.415
And you say she's innocent?

63
03:48.207 --> 03:50.293
Do you think I'm a fool?

64
03:55.131 --> 03:58.092
Why don't you suspect Furuse?

65
03:59.010 --> 04:03.431
If the issue in Konan City came to light, who would be in the most trouble?

66
04:03.931 --> 04:08.269
Mr. Furuse supported my mom and me after his death.

67
04:08.353 --> 04:11.064
He treated us like his family!

68
04:12.857 --> 04:14.400
Does that make him right?

69
04:14.484 --> 04:15.651
Shut up!

70
04:17.320 --> 04:20.490
I won't let you make any other moves.

71
04:20.573 --> 04:22.200
You…

72
04:23.409 --> 04:27.413
You will stay behind these thick walls, just like…

73
04:28.331 --> 04:30.208
that dear sister of yours.

74
04:32.502 --> 04:33.711
You…

75
04:34.504 --> 04:36.589
I'm sure you understand.

76
04:38.591 --> 04:43.012
An ant hole can collapse a thousand-mile dam.

77
04:45.932 --> 04:48.226
An ant hole…

78
04:49.435 --> 04:50.520
is all it takes.

79
05:00.029 --> 05:00.863
AN ANT HOLE

80
05:00.947 --> 05:03.241
Why did he say this?

81
05:03.324 --> 05:05.159
What is this stuff about ants?

82
05:05.743 --> 05:07.870
"An ant hole."

83
05:07.954 --> 05:09.622
No matter how sturdy the dam,

84
05:09.705 --> 05:12.250
if there's even a tiny hole the size of an ant,

85
05:12.333 --> 05:16.254
that hole will keep growing until the dam collapses.

86
05:16.337 --> 05:17.171
Right?

87
05:17.255 --> 05:18.965
-200 million! -Listen to me!

88
05:19.048 --> 05:20.800
-Look. -Oh, that's…

89
05:22.218 --> 05:25.179
I worked pretty hard on this one.

90
05:25.263 --> 05:27.974
What do you mean?

91
05:28.057 --> 05:29.976
Our office was designing this.

92
05:30.059 --> 05:32.311
Who would buy a one-bedroom for 200 million?

93
05:32.395 --> 05:34.564
The legendary Sendo Construction built it.

94
05:35.440 --> 05:37.859
The kitchen and living room are just as I drew!

95
05:37.942 --> 05:39.443
So, did you mess up this job?

96
05:39.527 --> 05:42.530
I didn't mess up. Our boss pulled out.

97
05:42.613 --> 05:44.323
Why did we pull out?

98
05:44.407 --> 05:45.491
I don't know.

99
05:45.575 --> 05:48.870
If we had accepted it, we would be relaxing, sipping coffee.

100
05:48.953 --> 05:50.454
I hate this.

101
05:50.955 --> 05:52.623
Aren't you relaxing right now?

102
05:52.707 --> 05:54.375
You think?

103
05:54.458 --> 05:57.461
I mean, why are you all so carefree?

104
05:58.379 --> 06:00.464
We should be protesting this!

105
06:00.548 --> 06:02.967
Besides, where did Mr. Kureta go?

106
06:03.551 --> 06:06.888
You were right. They carried out an inspection at our office.

107
06:06.971 --> 06:08.139
What about the file?

108
06:08.222 --> 06:10.141
They retrieved it without issue.

109
06:10.641 --> 06:13.769
Now we wait and see what the city office will do.

110
06:13.853 --> 06:15.605
Huh? Wait a minute.

111
06:16.105 --> 06:18.816
You knew an on-site inspection was coming?

112
06:18.900 --> 06:23.362
He caught wind of Furuse's secretary having contacted the city office.

113
06:23.446 --> 06:24.614
Scary.

114
06:25.114 --> 06:28.326
What a terrifying man. How scary.

115
06:28.409 --> 06:30.036
Moriki.

116
06:31.287 --> 06:33.497
No need to play dumb.

117
06:35.666 --> 06:39.587
Do you know about the Fortress of Szigetvár?

118
06:39.670 --> 06:40.963
Fortress of what?

119
06:41.505 --> 06:43.674
In 1566,

120
06:44.425 --> 06:47.595
facing an overwhelming attack by the Ottoman Empire,

121
06:47.678 --> 06:49.972
the Kingdom of Hungary's army

122
06:50.932 --> 06:54.769
blew up their fortress as a last resort,

123
06:56.604 --> 06:58.940
taking the enemy down with them.

124
07:00.024 --> 07:01.609
Mr. Kureta, what is he--

125
07:01.692 --> 07:06.447
If we die, we'll take them down with us.

126
07:07.073 --> 07:08.741
Give me a break.

127
07:13.538 --> 07:15.915
Why won't you issue building permits?

128
07:15.998 --> 07:18.543
We will, as soon as the investigation is over.

129
07:19.126 --> 07:21.295
Did you find a problem or something?

130
07:21.837 --> 07:23.089
I cannot answer that.

131
07:23.172 --> 07:25.883
"Cannot"? Hakari is a small office.

132
07:25.967 --> 07:29.971
If they can't operate, they'll lose client trust and go under.

133
07:30.054 --> 07:32.223
Is your office okay with that?

134
07:33.683 --> 07:36.477
Could it be that you're doing this because Hakari is a small--

135
07:36.561 --> 07:38.688
That's irrelevant.

136
07:39.772 --> 07:44.026
If there are suspicions, we'll investigate even large corporations.

137
07:44.110 --> 07:47.863
So, you really were suspicious of something?

138
07:49.407 --> 07:52.034
Did those above pressure you to…

139
07:52.118 --> 07:53.619
That is not the case!

140
07:55.955 --> 07:59.959
At least tell us what the issue was.

141
08:00.459 --> 08:02.086
SENDO CONSTRUCTION BAYSIDE CROWN HARUMI

142
08:02.169 --> 08:05.965
There were some suspicious transactions with Sendo Construction.

143
08:07.091 --> 08:09.552
Sendo Construction…

144
08:13.431 --> 08:15.516
I heard you met Uramawashi?

145
08:16.642 --> 08:18.060
How did you know that?

146
08:18.561 --> 08:21.022
You don't need to worry about him.

147
08:21.689 --> 08:24.317
There's nothing more he can do.

148
08:25.192 --> 08:27.069
-Come in. -Excuse me.

149
08:27.570 --> 08:30.239
President Hosokawa and Manager Kotake from Sendo are here.

150
08:30.323 --> 08:31.365
Good.

151
08:32.992 --> 08:36.704
Representative, it has been a long time.

152
08:36.787 --> 08:39.165
I always see you on TV.

153
08:39.248 --> 08:40.625
Oh, stop it.

154
08:41.167 --> 08:44.378
In our bureaucrat days, we fought tooth and nail together, didn't we?

155
08:45.004 --> 08:45.963
I am honored.

156
08:46.047 --> 08:48.507
Representative, allow me to introduce him.

157
08:48.591 --> 08:50.509
This is Kotake, our Division Manager.

158
08:50.593 --> 08:52.720
The name is Kotake. Pleased to meet you.

159
08:52.803 --> 08:55.765
Mr. Kotake. Please wait a moment.

160
08:56.557 --> 08:58.559
-I'm Furuse. -I am honored.

161
08:58.643 --> 09:02.146
Are you President Hosokawa's right-hand man? That is reassuring!

162
09:02.229 --> 09:03.439
Pleasure doing business.

163
09:03.522 --> 09:04.649
Likewise.

164
09:06.609 --> 09:09.070
Did something happen with Sendo Construction?

165
09:09.153 --> 09:11.489
You had transactions with them, right?

166
09:13.074 --> 09:15.493
Something must have happened, right?

167
09:16.035 --> 09:20.081
Besides, Sendo Construction has been building in Konan City for ten years.

168
09:20.164 --> 09:23.334
In other words, they are connected to Representative Furuse.

169
09:24.335 --> 09:26.045
You must have a goal here, right?

170
09:28.631 --> 09:30.383
I knew it.

171
09:33.260 --> 09:34.178
What?

172
09:34.762 --> 09:36.514
-Were you sleeping? -I wasn't.

173
09:36.597 --> 09:37.890
You definitely were!

174
09:37.973 --> 09:39.183
I wasn't.

175
09:39.684 --> 09:41.060
Come on…

176
09:41.644 --> 09:44.313
A 2.5 mm flaw.

177
09:44.397 --> 09:45.356
A flaw?

178
09:46.774 --> 09:50.778
In 1967, the 530-meter Silver Bridge

179
09:50.861 --> 09:56.701
over the Ohio River in America collapsed because of a 2.5 mm flaw.

180
09:56.784 --> 09:59.286
Yes, okay, ant's butt. I know.

181
09:59.370 --> 10:01.288
-More importantly… -Ant butt?

182
10:02.248 --> 10:06.419
What I want to know is your relationship with Sendo Construction…

183
10:06.502 --> 10:07.336
Time's up.

184
10:15.428 --> 10:16.721
Aso.

185
10:17.722 --> 10:21.392
Your assessment is generally correct.

186
10:30.276 --> 10:31.026
HAVE A GORGEOUS TIME

187
10:31.110 --> 10:34.238
Tell me about your relationship with Sendo Construction.

188
10:34.321 --> 10:36.282
Why did you pull out of this job?

189
10:38.284 --> 10:42.663
When constructing a building, the general contractor manages everything.

190
10:42.747 --> 10:44.790
-Sendo Construction? -Right.

191
10:44.874 --> 10:47.877
That Sendo Construction sent us a design request.

192
10:47.960 --> 10:52.339
They chose a company called Kawazu Boring, so we asked them to do a survey.

193
10:52.423 --> 10:53.591
"Boring"?

194
10:53.674 --> 10:55.551
It means drilling, in this case.

195
10:56.093 --> 10:59.722
And once the ground survey was done, based on those survey results,

196
10:59.805 --> 11:01.557
we proceeded with the design work.

197
11:01.640 --> 11:03.684
Based on the design plans we made,

198
11:03.768 --> 11:07.980
Kawazu Boring was supposed to proceed with the ground piling.

199
11:08.063 --> 11:09.982
I see.

200
11:10.065 --> 11:11.817
And when did Hakari pull out?

201
11:11.901 --> 11:15.279
After the design plans were finished. I drew up most of it!

202
11:15.362 --> 11:19.033
Yes, we know. So, what was the reason for pulling out?

203
11:19.783 --> 11:21.702
It was Kawazu Boring.

204
11:21.785 --> 11:24.413
They had to do piling work for 60 meters underground,

205
11:24.497 --> 11:27.958
but the schedule only gave them less than a week to do it.

206
11:28.042 --> 11:31.170
That is certainly strange.

207
11:31.253 --> 11:32.755
Why is it strange?

208
11:32.838 --> 11:36.008
In one week, you can only reinforce about 15 meters at most.

209
11:36.592 --> 11:38.427
The length and number of piles,

210
11:38.511 --> 11:42.056
the amount of concrete poured, the construction period…

211
11:42.932 --> 11:46.727
They'll save a lot of money. 20 million is a safe bet.

212
11:46.810 --> 11:48.312
So they cut corners?

213
11:48.395 --> 11:49.939
If our guess is true.

214
11:50.022 --> 11:53.317
It's underground. Once the building is erected, you can't tell.

215
11:53.400 --> 11:57.071
Could it be that Hakari was suspected because of this matter?

216
11:57.154 --> 11:58.656
That might be the case.

217
11:58.739 --> 12:00.282
I have something to attend to.

218
12:00.366 --> 12:01.200
What?

219
12:01.283 --> 12:02.660
I'll leave the rest to you.

220
12:02.743 --> 12:03.994
BOSS KURETA NEW MESSAGE

221
12:05.412 --> 12:07.289
Shall we get going too?

222
12:07.373 --> 12:08.624
Goodbye.

223
12:15.798 --> 12:18.842
Feels like it's our side

224
12:18.926 --> 12:20.928
that is about to collapse.

225
12:22.304 --> 12:23.556
SENDO

226
12:23.639 --> 12:26.016
These are the documents from our work with Sendo.

227
12:26.100 --> 12:27.393
Thank you very much.

228
12:27.476 --> 12:30.312
Please, clear my name.

229
12:30.813 --> 12:32.064
I'll do my best.

230
12:32.147 --> 12:33.774
Yeah. Bye.

231
12:52.459 --> 12:53.961
TAKESHI'S BODY FOUND IN PARKING LOT

232
12:56.255 --> 12:57.923
Don't do anything unnecessary!

233
12:58.007 --> 12:59.091
FURUSE'S SECRETARY MUROTA

234
13:01.218 --> 13:02.344
ATTORNEY HINATA

235
13:02.428 --> 13:05.431
You won't be able to practice law ever again.

236
13:11.478 --> 13:13.606
That article about Ms. Shiramoto…

237
13:14.398 --> 13:16.233
Was that a fabrication too?

238
13:16.317 --> 13:17.234
MURDER SUSPICION

239
13:19.778 --> 13:21.864
TEITO MEDICAL UNIVERSITY

240
13:21.947 --> 13:24.742
Teito Medical University…

241
13:25.242 --> 13:27.077
Back then…

242
13:34.251 --> 13:35.252
Hello.

243
13:35.336 --> 13:37.296
Maki! Why are you here?

244
13:37.379 --> 13:40.341
You weren't coming back, so I was told to bring you a case.

245
13:40.424 --> 13:42.343
I don't have time for that--

246
13:42.426 --> 13:44.470
I'm only the messenger.

247
13:45.137 --> 13:46.889
-Please, come in. -Come in?

248
13:59.485 --> 14:01.945
This is clearly an affair, isn't it?

249
14:02.029 --> 14:03.822
Who… took this photo?

250
14:03.906 --> 14:05.783
I don't know.

251
14:05.866 --> 14:08.786
It was sent to me out of nowhere a few days ago.

252
14:08.869 --> 14:12.039
When I confronted my husband, he kept insisting it was work.

253
14:12.122 --> 14:13.374
Work?

254
14:13.457 --> 14:16.752
Mrs. Kawazu's husband is the president of Kawazu Boring.

255
14:17.544 --> 14:19.588
The other woman is an employee there.

256
14:19.672 --> 14:20.839
Kawazu Boring?

257
14:20.923 --> 14:23.300
No way this isn't an affair!

258
14:23.384 --> 14:27.429
They went to the same room, but didn't do anything? Laughable!

259
14:27.513 --> 14:30.099
What are you requesting?

260
14:30.766 --> 14:34.144
I want the other woman to admit it and pay compensation for my distress.

261
14:35.854 --> 14:38.232
A case related to Kawazu Boring, coming now…

262
14:38.315 --> 14:41.026
I bet Mr. Moriki has an ulterior motive.

263
14:41.110 --> 14:42.444
Looks like it.

264
14:42.528 --> 14:47.241
He asked me to support you, since my forte is divorce litigation.

265
14:47.324 --> 14:48.450
Is that so?

266
14:48.534 --> 14:49.410
Yeah.

267
14:51.036 --> 14:54.915
I did some background research on the employee he has been seen with.

268
14:54.999 --> 14:57.501
I'll gladly accept your help.

269
14:58.127 --> 15:00.838
Well then, with Mrs. Kawazu's cooperation,

270
15:00.921 --> 15:03.966
I've set up a meeting with Kawazu Boring for tomorrow.

271
15:04.049 --> 15:05.509
I'll go get some good info.

272
15:05.592 --> 15:07.219
I'm counting on you.

273
15:19.857 --> 15:23.902
I have an appointment with President Kawazu for a legal seminar.

274
15:24.486 --> 15:27.364
I am Maki Tsunehiro from Cordia Law Firm.

275
15:27.448 --> 15:28.323
SENDO CONSTRUCTION

276
15:28.407 --> 15:30.409
-Let me check. -Okay.

277
15:44.631 --> 15:46.884
KAWAZU BORING GENERAL AFFAIRS - ACCOUNTING

278
15:49.470 --> 15:54.016
His affair partner is Kaori Yamauchi from the accounting department.

279
15:54.099 --> 15:56.935
A veteran who has been with the company for 20 years.

280
16:03.942 --> 16:04.818
Yes?

281
16:05.694 --> 16:07.196
Mrs. Kawazu?

282
16:07.863 --> 16:10.324
Credit card history?

283
16:11.992 --> 16:13.285
Yes.

284
16:13.368 --> 16:16.872
For a major firm like Cordia to host a seminar for us…

285
16:17.456 --> 16:20.626
Seems my wife actually did something good for once.

286
16:20.709 --> 16:23.003
We must thank you too.

287
16:23.087 --> 16:24.129
Please excuse me.

288
16:24.213 --> 16:26.507
-Thank you very much. -Yes, excuse me.

289
16:39.853 --> 16:43.190
Yamauchi is heading home. I'm going to follow her.

290
16:44.274 --> 16:46.151
I'll contact you later.

291
16:52.741 --> 16:55.202
Maki, why are you at this hospital?

292
16:59.373 --> 17:03.418
The girl in the wheelchair is Kaori Yamauchi's daughter.

293
17:03.502 --> 17:04.336
What?

294
17:04.419 --> 17:06.255
I overheard just now.

295
17:06.338 --> 17:10.592
It seems she has a heart condition and had surgery three months ago.

296
17:11.635 --> 17:15.347
I have to head back, so I'll leave things here to you.

297
17:15.889 --> 17:17.349
Thank you very much.

298
17:25.983 --> 17:27.317
Excuse me.

299
17:28.068 --> 17:30.320
Are you Kaori Yamauchi?

300
17:30.404 --> 17:31.572
Yes.

301
17:32.781 --> 17:36.118
My name is Aso. I'm a lawyer.

302
17:36.201 --> 17:37.619
A lawyer?

303
17:38.871 --> 17:40.205
What can I do for you?

304
17:41.039 --> 17:42.332
Actually,

305
17:43.792 --> 17:45.085
it's about Mr. Kawazu.

306
17:47.963 --> 17:50.007
Saori, let's go back to your room.

307
17:50.090 --> 17:51.008
Yeah.

308
17:51.592 --> 17:53.093
I'm so sorry, Ms. Ono.

309
17:53.177 --> 17:54.094
It's okay.

310
17:58.557 --> 17:59.975
What do you want?

311
18:01.143 --> 18:05.814
Mrs. Kawazu is requesting compensation due to your affair with Mr. Kawazu.

312
18:05.898 --> 18:06.899
An affair?

313
18:07.441 --> 18:08.901
That's ridiculous!

314
18:10.402 --> 18:12.404
No way I would do such a thing!

315
18:14.239 --> 18:15.407
This is a nuisance.

316
18:16.158 --> 18:18.160
Please don't ever come here again.

317
18:20.329 --> 18:22.998
Being a single mother with a chronically ill daughter…

318
18:23.582 --> 18:25.125
Must be so tough.

319
18:25.209 --> 18:26.376
Yeah.

320
18:26.460 --> 18:27.961
Even with insurance,

321
18:28.045 --> 18:31.506
congenital heart disease costs a considerable amount of money.

322
18:31.590 --> 18:33.634
The surgery expenses are no joke either.

323
18:33.717 --> 18:35.552
That's true.

324
18:36.094 --> 18:38.764
Also, Mrs. Kawazu called me.

325
18:38.847 --> 18:40.140
Looking at the credit card history,

326
18:40.224 --> 18:42.851
the payment to this hotel was six months ago.

327
18:42.935 --> 18:45.020
So she went to the hotel six months ago,

328
18:45.103 --> 18:48.732
and after that her daughter underwent an expensive surgery?

329
18:48.815 --> 18:50.984
That would be the case.

330
18:53.070 --> 18:54.112
And…

331
18:54.738 --> 18:57.908
when I brought up President Kawazu's name at the hospital,

332
18:57.991 --> 19:01.161
Ms. Yamauchi was visibly shaken.

333
19:01.245 --> 19:02.704
So it really is an affair?

334
19:02.788 --> 19:06.083
No, something felt off.

335
19:06.166 --> 19:08.460
There it is, your intuition.

336
19:10.170 --> 19:12.673
For the sake of our client, Mrs. Kawazu, as well,

337
19:12.756 --> 19:15.300
we need to verify whether the affair is real or not.

338
19:15.384 --> 19:16.593
All right.

339
19:17.427 --> 19:20.472
Why did a president and an employee who weren't together

340
19:20.555 --> 19:23.267
decide to meet in a hotel room?

341
19:27.771 --> 19:30.649
Bayside Crown Harumi.

342
19:32.192 --> 19:35.904
So expensive. 200 million for a one-bedroom?

343
19:36.905 --> 19:39.032
Right?

344
19:40.075 --> 19:41.285
KAWAZU BORING

345
19:43.412 --> 19:44.705
It was Kawazu Boring.

346
19:44.788 --> 19:46.790
The length and number of piles,

347
19:46.873 --> 19:50.460
the amount of concrete poured, the construction period…

348
19:51.336 --> 19:52.921
They'll save a lot of money.

349
19:53.547 --> 19:55.215
20 million is a safe bet.

350
20:03.140 --> 20:05.600
Don't tell me… Cash?

351
20:09.021 --> 20:10.230
Sir.

352
20:10.314 --> 20:12.858
Here is the draft for the mayor's press conference.

353
20:12.941 --> 20:13.984
Thank you.

354
20:14.776 --> 20:15.861
Um…

355
20:17.321 --> 20:18.322
What's wrong?

356
20:18.405 --> 20:19.531
It's nothing.

357
20:20.032 --> 20:23.702
I'm just concerned about the actions of a city official named Tachibana.

358
20:23.785 --> 20:27.664
Plus, it seems that female lawyer met with her.

359
20:30.167 --> 20:31.376
-Donghyuk. -Yes.

360
20:31.460 --> 20:34.713
You know her, right? Probe into it a little.

361
20:34.796 --> 20:35.630
Understood.

362
20:35.714 --> 20:38.050
Then I will deal with the city office.

363
20:38.759 --> 20:40.093
I'm counting on you.

364
20:43.889 --> 20:46.767
When you're in accounting, you see all kinds of money.

365
20:46.850 --> 20:47.684
Ms. Konno?

366
20:47.768 --> 20:49.895
So, what if they falsified the ground data?

367
20:49.978 --> 20:51.813
Naturally, accounting would track it,

368
20:51.897 --> 20:55.192
and they would have to process the falsified difference somehow.

369
20:55.275 --> 20:58.278
Process… Like by converting it to cash?

370
20:58.362 --> 21:00.280
Yeah, something like that.

371
21:00.364 --> 21:03.909
Mr. Kureta, I think Kawazu Boring really was falsifying data.

372
21:03.992 --> 21:06.036
They certainly look guilty,

373
21:06.119 --> 21:09.289
but a condo is already being built on top of that ground.

374
21:09.373 --> 21:11.917
You mean all of our evidence has been buried.

375
21:12.000 --> 21:13.210
Unfortunately, yes.

376
21:13.293 --> 21:15.253
I wouldn't do it myself,

377
21:15.337 --> 21:19.299
but if it were Mr. Uramawashi, he would lie to pull out the evidence.

378
21:19.383 --> 21:21.009
Bingo.

379
21:22.719 --> 21:24.304
You certainly have…

380
21:25.347 --> 21:26.765
grown a bit.

381
21:27.391 --> 21:29.851
Mr. Uramawashi, welcome back!

382
21:30.352 --> 21:33.063
-You're overdoing it. -We were waiting for you!

383
21:36.608 --> 21:37.943
Mr. Uramawashi!

384
21:39.653 --> 21:40.487
Thank you.

385
21:40.570 --> 21:43.240
-Congratulations on getting out of jail. -I wasn't in jail.

386
21:43.323 --> 21:44.658
Mr. Uramawashi!

387
21:45.534 --> 21:46.618
Thank you.

388
21:46.701 --> 21:48.745
-How was jail? -I told you, I wasn't in jail!

389
21:48.829 --> 21:51.081
Mr. Uramawashi, you're so late.

390
21:51.164 --> 21:53.458
They sure held you for as long as they could.

391
21:53.542 --> 21:56.002
And you weren't indicted. All according to plan?

392
21:56.586 --> 22:00.340
Looks like things aren't going too well for you.

393
22:03.093 --> 22:05.137
Shall I help you out, as usual?

394
22:05.971 --> 22:07.097
No, thank you.

395
22:14.479 --> 22:18.150
Where do you think Ms. Aso's dedication comes from?

396
22:18.233 --> 22:19.526
I don't care.

397
22:21.027 --> 22:24.823
I've started to think you and Ms. Aso are kind of similar in some ways.

398
22:24.906 --> 22:25.740
What?

399
22:26.324 --> 22:28.201
Wait a minute.

400
22:28.285 --> 22:32.038
You both doggedly pursue the truth.

401
22:32.122 --> 22:33.874
No way. That can't be.

402
22:35.792 --> 22:37.252
Here you go.

403
22:37.752 --> 22:41.464
The cases that piled up during your detention. Take care of them.

404
22:42.716 --> 22:45.510
The crime you committed wasn't adultery,

405
22:45.594 --> 22:49.848
but issuing fake invoices to clients to cover for the false ground data.

406
22:49.931 --> 22:51.266
Am I wrong?

407
22:51.766 --> 22:53.310
What are you talking about?

408
22:54.352 --> 22:55.896
Bayside Crown Harumi.

409
22:56.771 --> 23:01.526
Six months ago, in this picture, you were carrying

410
23:02.569 --> 23:04.571
a stack of cash, right?

411
23:05.155 --> 23:08.617
And you handed that money to President Kawazu.

412
23:09.868 --> 23:12.621
Do you have proof?

413
23:14.748 --> 23:16.041
I don't.

414
23:17.125 --> 23:20.837
So, I want you to blow the whistle.

415
23:22.172 --> 23:26.551
That apartment complex requires a foundation 60 meters deep.

416
23:27.052 --> 23:29.429
If disaster strikes and it collapses,

417
23:29.512 --> 23:33.683
it would cause great damage to both residents and the surrounding area.

418
23:34.351 --> 23:35.936
In that area, there is…

419
23:36.645 --> 23:39.397
an elementary school and even a kindergarten.

420
23:40.398 --> 23:42.817
If something irreversible happens…

421
23:46.571 --> 23:47.697
Kaori.

422
23:55.497 --> 23:59.584
I had no other choice.

423
24:01.628 --> 24:03.922
At first, I didn't know.

424
24:07.467 --> 24:08.969
The other day,

425
24:09.052 --> 24:12.639
I processed an order to Harada Concrete, but there appears to be an error.

426
24:12.722 --> 24:14.057
An error?

427
24:14.140 --> 24:18.019
The amount was less than what Sendo Construction ordered.

428
24:18.103 --> 24:20.772
I see.

429
24:20.855 --> 24:23.692
But you've already processed it, right?

430
24:23.775 --> 24:24.776
Yes.

431
24:24.859 --> 24:25.777
Okay.

432
24:25.860 --> 24:28.446
Well then, I have one favor to ask.

433
24:28.530 --> 24:33.118
Could you give me that difference in cash?

434
24:34.077 --> 24:34.995
What?

435
24:36.705 --> 24:39.958
You're having a tough time with your daughter, right?

436
24:42.585 --> 24:44.004
But…

437
24:44.754 --> 24:46.798
It wasn't just a one-time thing.

438
24:47.340 --> 24:49.009
Yamauchi,

439
24:49.092 --> 24:52.929
the place where you will hand over the cash next time--

440
24:53.013 --> 24:54.306
President!

441
24:54.389 --> 24:57.267
Isn't this a crime?

442
24:57.350 --> 24:59.144
Yes, but you're already involved.

443
24:59.227 --> 25:01.730
You can't just say "I didn't know" anymore.

444
25:03.273 --> 25:06.192
You are an accomplice.

445
25:06.693 --> 25:10.780
You don't want to go to prison and leave your sick daughter behind, do you?

446
25:12.824 --> 25:16.244
So the falsifying of ground data happened often at your company?

447
25:18.079 --> 25:18.997
Yes.

448
25:20.540 --> 25:23.293
Was President Kawazu behind all of this?

449
25:23.376 --> 25:24.419
No.

450
25:25.128 --> 25:29.132
Manager Kotake from Sendo Construction ordered him to do it.

451
25:29.758 --> 25:31.009
Sendo Construction?

452
25:31.509 --> 25:33.136
There is a secret ledger.

453
25:33.219 --> 25:36.056
If you look at it, you'll see the cash flow.

454
25:37.265 --> 25:39.476
Where is that secret ledger?

455
25:40.018 --> 25:42.520
President Kawazu and Kotake have one.

456
25:42.604 --> 25:44.439
But I don't know where.

457
25:45.940 --> 25:52.030
You didn't go to the hotel for an affair, but to hand over the cash, correct?

458
25:53.490 --> 25:54.407
Yes.

459
25:56.117 --> 25:57.744
I believe you.

460
25:59.662 --> 26:03.750
Since you participated in a crime, it's likely you'll be found guilty.

461
26:04.793 --> 26:05.752
However,

462
26:06.961 --> 26:11.299
if your testimony is true, we might get you a suspended sentence.

463
26:12.008 --> 26:15.303
We can also claim damages from the company.

464
26:16.304 --> 26:20.266
I will explain the circumstances to Mrs. Kawazu and defend you.

465
26:21.184 --> 26:25.355
However, for that, we need evidence that you were threatened.

466
26:26.106 --> 26:27.607
Evidence?

467
26:28.817 --> 26:30.443
Mom!

468
26:31.027 --> 26:32.112
Saori?

469
26:44.916 --> 26:47.419
You heard everything, didn't you?

470
26:47.502 --> 26:49.212
You knew I was here?

471
26:49.963 --> 26:53.007
Sendo Construction and Mr. Furuse are connected, aren't they?

472
26:53.091 --> 26:54.551
They are.

473
26:55.176 --> 26:59.013
Even after hearing what was just said, you still believe in Mr. Furuse?

474
26:59.097 --> 27:00.223
Yes.

475
27:01.307 --> 27:04.644
Even if the slush money went to Representative Furuse?

476
27:04.727 --> 27:07.021
That is untrue.

477
27:11.776 --> 27:13.653
May I ask one thing?

478
27:13.736 --> 27:14.863
What is it?

479
27:15.405 --> 27:17.782
What kind of person was your father?

480
27:23.913 --> 27:25.874
Sorry, I shouldn't have asked.

481
27:27.834 --> 27:29.586
He was a very earnest

482
27:31.296 --> 27:33.173
and sincere person.

483
27:34.132 --> 27:35.717
Sincere?

484
27:36.843 --> 27:38.344
What about it?

485
27:39.929 --> 27:42.432
What do you think such a sincere father

486
27:42.932 --> 27:46.227
would have thought if he heard Ms. Shiramoto's story?

487
27:50.398 --> 27:55.778
I don't blindly believe everything Mr. Uramawashi says either.

488
27:56.488 --> 28:00.158
However, I want to know the truth of the matter.

489
28:07.081 --> 28:08.208
What did you say?

490
28:08.291 --> 28:11.127
I cannot cooperate with you any further.

491
28:11.711 --> 28:13.671
That won't do!

492
28:13.755 --> 28:18.051
You took the money! I gave you plenty to pay for your daughter's expenses!

493
28:18.134 --> 28:20.136
I had no choice but to accept it!

494
28:20.220 --> 28:21.804
Don't mess with me!

495
28:22.347 --> 28:24.390
Do you want to go to prison?

496
28:25.517 --> 28:28.019
You have no right to refuse.

497
28:28.102 --> 28:31.606
Just shut up and process the money.

498
28:32.941 --> 28:37.153
And you're saying Kotake, Sendo Construction's manager, ordered it?

499
28:37.237 --> 28:38.112
Yes.

500
28:38.196 --> 28:42.659
Kotake might destroy the evidence. We should investigate immediately.

501
28:45.328 --> 28:48.331
Ms. Tachibana, you won't actually do it, right?

502
28:49.165 --> 28:51.751
Management told you not to do anything unnecessary!

503
28:51.835 --> 28:53.044
So what?

504
28:54.337 --> 28:56.256
Those arrogant pricks at Sendo.

505
28:56.339 --> 28:59.008
All the trouble they have put us through!

506
28:59.801 --> 29:02.095
Don't do anything unnecessary?

507
29:02.679 --> 29:04.639
This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!

508
29:05.515 --> 29:07.600
Hurry and prepare for an inspection!

509
29:51.644 --> 29:53.855
An ant hole.

510
30:08.077 --> 30:09.078
Manager Kotake.

511
30:10.246 --> 30:14.292
We have someone named Tachibana from the Building Division at reception.

512
30:14.375 --> 30:16.336
They're here for an on-site inspection.

513
30:16.419 --> 30:17.462
Inspection?

514
30:17.545 --> 30:20.048
Should we send them up?

515
30:21.215 --> 30:23.134
Go downstairs and meet them.

516
30:24.677 --> 30:27.013
Also, buy a little more time.

517
30:27.680 --> 30:30.058
Understood. I'm on it.

518
30:32.477 --> 30:35.229
Nobody told me about any inspections!

519
30:35.730 --> 30:36.648
PASSWORD

520
30:37.565 --> 30:40.109
INPUT YOUR PASSWORD

521
30:45.990 --> 30:47.241
DELETE

522
30:48.618 --> 30:49.577
DELETE THIS FILE?

523
30:49.661 --> 30:50.495
DELETING

524
30:50.578 --> 30:51.412
DELETED

525
30:54.040 --> 30:55.875
Oh, that's right.

526
30:57.126 --> 31:02.048
We are missing one entry pass, so please wait a moment.

527
31:02.131 --> 31:04.342
Just take us there. Some of us can wait.

528
31:04.425 --> 31:06.094
-Please wait a moment. -We're sorry.

529
31:06.177 --> 31:09.013
First, please write your names. Did you already write them?

530
31:25.571 --> 31:27.573
Officials came for an inspection.

531
31:28.282 --> 31:29.826
What did you say?

532
31:30.702 --> 31:32.203
Don't tell me… She…

533
31:32.286 --> 31:34.288
They might go over there too.

534
31:34.372 --> 31:37.000
Hurry up and delete the secret ledger data.

535
31:37.583 --> 31:38.668
Yes, got it.

536
31:42.463 --> 31:45.758
-Sorry for the wait. Your Doremi Pizza. -Pizza?

537
31:45.842 --> 31:47.051
I didn't order that!

538
31:47.135 --> 31:48.720
You didn't? That can't be right.

539
31:48.803 --> 31:49.929
Leave it over there!

540
31:50.013 --> 31:51.055
DELETE

541
31:51.139 --> 31:52.515
DELETE THIS FILE?

542
31:53.558 --> 31:54.684
YES

543
31:56.310 --> 31:57.145
What?

544
32:02.150 --> 32:04.902
MEETING ROOM

545
32:10.783 --> 32:12.660
What's this?

546
32:30.762 --> 32:33.556
Got the data. Sent it to Sabayama.

547
32:33.639 --> 32:34.974
Roger that.

548
32:37.727 --> 32:40.563
Sorry for the wait. Over here, please.

549
32:42.648 --> 32:43.941
Follow me.

550
32:44.025 --> 32:46.235
Nakazaki, I sent the data.

551
32:52.408 --> 32:53.701
All right.

552
33:20.394 --> 33:21.771
Kotake is heading back.

553
33:21.854 --> 33:22.688
Huh?

554
33:27.276 --> 33:29.195
The printing isn't done yet.

555
33:29.278 --> 33:32.532
Don't panic, Sabayama. Keep going.

556
33:33.616 --> 33:34.867
I'll buy some time.

557
33:34.951 --> 33:36.035
Give me a break.

558
33:39.288 --> 33:40.665
I'm sorry.

559
33:43.334 --> 33:44.710
Out of the way!

560
33:44.794 --> 33:46.212
Sorry!

561
34:10.987 --> 34:12.488
Are you Manager Kotake?

562
34:12.572 --> 34:13.489
Yes.

563
34:13.573 --> 34:16.242
I am Tachibana from the district's Building Division,

564
34:16.325 --> 34:17.577
here for an inspection.

565
34:18.619 --> 34:20.163
We ask for your cooperation.

566
34:20.746 --> 34:23.749
A sudden on-site inspection? What is this about?

567
34:23.833 --> 34:26.419
We found some suspicious transactions.

568
34:26.502 --> 34:29.964
Can you show us the transactions you made over the past six months?

569
34:30.047 --> 34:32.258
I understand. Get the documents.

570
34:33.676 --> 34:34.802
Let's search.

571
34:34.886 --> 34:35.720
Yes.

572
34:36.762 --> 34:37.930
Keep up the good work.

573
34:38.014 --> 34:40.224
We're here for an inspection. Please cooperate.

574
34:40.892 --> 34:42.185
What is this?

575
34:53.070 --> 34:54.322
Is something wrong?

576
34:54.405 --> 34:56.240
I forgot I have a meeting.

577
34:56.324 --> 34:59.035
Before you go, could I take a look inside your bag?

578
34:59.118 --> 35:00.244
Excuse me.

579
35:00.328 --> 35:01.829
Manager Kotake!

580
35:05.499 --> 35:06.667
Stop!

581
35:10.129 --> 35:11.881
Hold on!

582
35:15.092 --> 35:17.345
He went to the lobby, just like our script.

583
35:21.849 --> 35:23.684
The city office sure is amazing.

584
35:24.268 --> 35:26.979
Right on time, the real Tachibana has arrived.

585
35:27.605 --> 35:30.983
We are here for an on-site inspection of Sendo Construction.

586
35:31.067 --> 35:34.195
-Where is General Manager Kotake? -Who might you be?

587
35:34.278 --> 35:36.489
I am Tachibana from the Building Division.

588
35:36.572 --> 35:37.949
I will check.

589
35:38.032 --> 35:39.533
Tachibana?

590
36:00.554 --> 36:03.766
That… someone slipped it into my bag…

591
36:04.433 --> 36:05.393
Nakaza.

592
36:05.977 --> 36:07.186
Now.

593
36:10.064 --> 36:12.233
Officials came for an inspection.

594
36:13.985 --> 36:15.820
They might go over there too.

595
36:16.862 --> 36:19.448
Hurry up and delete the secret ledger data.

596
36:20.032 --> 36:22.326
-I'm counting on you. -No, this is…

597
36:32.128 --> 36:34.505
Hey! Delete it right now!

598
36:40.469 --> 36:42.430
Is this your secret ledger?

599
36:42.513 --> 36:45.391
No… This must be some kind of mistake.

600
36:47.727 --> 36:49.103
A mistake?

601
36:50.646 --> 36:52.982
We will thoroughly investigate this.

602
36:53.983 --> 36:56.235
What the heck is going on?

603
36:56.777 --> 36:58.946
Do you realize what you're doing?

604
36:59.780 --> 37:01.073
We are Sendo Construction!

605
37:01.157 --> 37:03.200
So what of it?

606
37:06.787 --> 37:09.206
The size of the company does not matter.

607
37:10.291 --> 37:14.420
If there are suspicions, no matter how big the corporation is,

608
37:14.503 --> 37:17.006
no matter which bigshot politician is backing it,

609
37:17.590 --> 37:18.716
we will investigate!

610
37:18.799 --> 37:19.633
That's right!

611
37:45.576 --> 37:48.371
We finally made it this far, huh?

612
37:48.454 --> 37:51.749
We can work on big jobs together again.

613
37:51.832 --> 37:54.085
Konan City has decided to proceed

614
37:54.168 --> 37:57.338
with the license applications for an integrated resort,

615
37:57.421 --> 38:00.091
with many amenities,

616
38:00.174 --> 38:03.052
including a casino.

617
38:04.136 --> 38:05.388
Moving forward,

618
38:05.471 --> 38:09.600
together with private business operators interested in the IR business…

619
38:10.476 --> 38:12.019
Yes?

620
38:14.188 --> 38:15.189
What?

621
38:16.774 --> 38:17.691
Excuse me.

622
38:17.775 --> 38:19.110
Sir!

623
38:20.486 --> 38:21.654
We have a problem.

624
38:21.737 --> 38:22.780
What happened?

625
38:27.201 --> 38:28.452
BREAKING NEWS

626
38:28.536 --> 38:31.205
SENDO GROUP'S 200 MILLION YEN MISAPPROPRIATION SCANDAL

627
38:31.288 --> 38:32.248
Mayor!

628
38:32.331 --> 38:35.543
We just got news about Sendo's 200 million yen scandal.

629
38:35.626 --> 38:37.253
What are your thoughts?

630
38:37.336 --> 38:39.713
Sendo Construction also participated in the expo, right?

631
38:39.797 --> 38:41.966
Will Sendo take part in building the resort?

632
38:42.049 --> 38:43.926
How will this affect the resort?

633
38:44.009 --> 38:46.220
Regarding this matter,

634
38:46.303 --> 38:50.224
I will not make any comments at the moment.

635
38:50.307 --> 38:54.311
-People won't be satisfied with that! -You're involved too, aren't you, Mayor?

636
38:54.395 --> 38:57.106
Today's press conference is over!

637
38:57.189 --> 38:59.650
Thank you very much for today.

638
39:07.074 --> 39:08.576
SENDO GROUP'S 200 MILLION YEN SCANDAL

639
39:19.670 --> 39:21.589
An ant hole…

640
39:25.843 --> 39:27.678
In the video Nakazaki recorded,

641
39:27.761 --> 39:31.432
Mr. Kureta was seen slipping in a red file.

642
39:33.184 --> 39:35.561
What is this red file?

643
39:36.687 --> 39:41.317
In order to expose Sendo Construction's corruption…

644
39:43.235 --> 39:45.488
I prepared some fake documents.

645
39:46.030 --> 39:47.156
Fake?

646
39:48.073 --> 39:50.534
So this was your ant hole?

647
39:50.618 --> 39:51.744
Bingo.

648
39:53.579 --> 39:58.626
You took down the accountant, Kaori Yamauchi.

649
39:58.709 --> 40:00.002
That was impressive.

650
40:00.085 --> 40:01.587
Ms. Yamauchi?

651
40:02.087 --> 40:03.881
Don't tell me, even that affair photo…

652
40:09.762 --> 40:13.849
I merely acted of my own free will.

653
40:21.690 --> 40:23.234
Scary.

654
40:34.245 --> 40:35.204
Next time,

655
40:35.287 --> 40:39.667
you'll have to defend Kaori Yamauchi from the opposing side.

656
40:40.251 --> 40:41.293
Sounds tough.

657
40:41.377 --> 40:44.964
What kind of relationship do you have with Mr. Uramawashi?

658
40:45.047 --> 40:48.467
This time, you were clearly helping him out behind the scenes!

659
40:48.551 --> 40:51.011
Me, helping Mr. Uramawashi behind the scenes?

660
40:51.095 --> 40:53.138
Mr. Uramawashi, behind the scenes?

661
40:53.681 --> 40:56.433
That's funny! What a joke!

662
40:56.517 --> 40:58.519
Please don't play dumb.

663
40:59.311 --> 41:02.940
I think you resemble Mr. Uramawashi.

664
41:03.023 --> 41:05.818
That's impossible! Don't dodge the question. Answer me.

665
41:05.901 --> 41:06.735
Well…

666
41:07.319 --> 41:10.906
He and I are comrades. We want to save the same person.

667
41:11.574 --> 41:12.825
I think that sums it up.

668
41:14.660 --> 41:17.955
Ms. Aso. There's a letter for you.

669
41:21.250 --> 41:23.460
MIYUKI SHIRAMOTO

670
41:27.923 --> 41:31.885
I bet even Furuse will feel the damage from this case.

671
41:32.553 --> 41:37.057
If so, he'll do everything to crush us.

672
41:40.352 --> 41:41.395
What?

673
41:58.954 --> 42:02.124
Yukari, I have a request.

674
42:03.334 --> 42:07.463
Could you bring Naoto Uramawashi here?

675
42:12.760 --> 42:15.721
How was life in the detention cell?

676
42:15.804 --> 42:19.642
Thanks to you, it was time well spent.

677
42:20.392 --> 42:22.603
Looks like things were tough for you too.

678
42:22.686 --> 42:26.398
Yeah, thanks to you things sure got lively.

679
42:28.400 --> 42:30.778
I'll get straight to the point.

680
42:33.113 --> 42:34.698
What is your goal?

681
42:37.284 --> 42:39.662
To clear my sister's name.

682
42:40.412 --> 42:41.872
That's all.

683
42:43.374 --> 42:45.918
Is that all?

684
42:49.630 --> 42:53.634
I cannot accept your childish way of thinking.

685
42:54.468 --> 42:56.136
Childish?

686
42:57.137 --> 43:01.100
It seems you don't understand how this country works.

687
43:04.228 --> 43:08.023
You are acting for the sake of a single individual.

688
43:09.024 --> 43:10.901
However, because of that,

689
43:11.485 --> 43:14.738
it is possible that the development of this nation

690
43:14.822 --> 43:16.907
will be delayed.

691
43:18.701 --> 43:22.287
For the future of this country that I am trying to build,

692
43:23.330 --> 43:26.583
for the sake of the nation and its people,

693
43:27.543 --> 43:29.336
please do not stand in my way.

694
43:29.420 --> 43:34.466
A future built upon lies is a castle built on sand.

695
43:38.387 --> 43:39.930
It will collapse eventually.

696
43:42.975 --> 43:46.520
Let me give you a little piece of advice.

697
44:08.625 --> 44:13.213
There is something I must tell him.

698
44:14.423 --> 44:17.176
MIYUKI SHIRAMOTO

699
44:18.427 --> 44:20.721
You really became a lawyer, didn't you?

700
44:22.055 --> 44:23.307
Well, yeah.

701
44:26.310 --> 44:29.730
You involved Yukari in this so you could meet me.

702
44:32.107 --> 44:35.068
I know you so well.

703
44:36.236 --> 44:38.489
Since I refused to meet you,

704
44:38.989 --> 44:43.452
you relied on Yukari, the only person I see.

705
44:46.038 --> 44:48.832
But it's okay now.

706
44:50.334 --> 44:52.127
Ms. Shiramoto?

707
45:00.427 --> 45:02.304
Those who framed you, I can--

708
45:02.387 --> 45:04.264
I killed Nitou.

709
45:07.476 --> 45:11.230
So please, don't worry about me anymore.

710
45:19.196 --> 45:24.243
Your sister will definitely turn you away.

711
45:36.880 --> 45:39.216
Why don't we verify what happened ten years ago?

712
45:39.800 --> 45:41.176
Leave me alone!

713
45:41.260 --> 45:43.929
Now that it has come to this, we have to fight.

714
45:44.012 --> 45:45.472
I'll go along with your lies.

715
45:45.556 --> 45:49.393
For that, we need a special pillar.

716
45:49.476 --> 45:52.187
Isn't it time you made your move?

717
45:54.147 --> 45:55.649
We were deceived?

718
45:57.526 --> 45:58.485
Subtitle translation by: Nix S.
